text:
Iran's IRGC announces it carried out the single largest attack in the Strait of Hormuz, striking 6 vessels with anti-ship missiles in retaliation for this morning's US strike on 3 Iranian oil tankers transiting the Strait.

The IRGC says it struck 3 oil tankers transiting the "unauthorized" routes in the Strait of Hormuz, and 3 additional US Navy warships and US-linked vessels in other areas.
@HormuzLetter

Iranian military spokesman Akrami Nia: 

"We have changed our doctrine. We will carry out preemptive actions whenever we feel threatened, and this will be within the framework of international law."
